Based on DerekParks' 2026-10-27 synchronous-client workaround:
https://github.com/qualcomm/fastrpc/issues/377#issuecomment-6448751906

The matched ASUS Glymur 00304 shell requires method 9 to consume packets.
Opt in only for clients using a synchronous request/response pattern. This
is not a general asynchronous queue pump. Unlike the original proof of
concept, require env=1 and propagate invocation errors to the caller.

